# Optional settings for the Debrief companion.
# To use them, copy this file to a new file named .env (in this same folder)
# and remove the # in front of the lines you want. Never commit .env to GitHub.

# Your Anthropic API key. You can paste it in Debrief's Settings instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Folder to watch for trade exports (default: your Downloads folder).
# DEBRIEF_WATCH_DIR=/Users/you/Downloads

# Where Debrief keeps backups, the news calendar, saved charts and your AI key.
# Default on a Mac: ~/Library/Application Support/Debrief. Keep it outside this project folder.
# DEBRIEF_DATA_DIR=/Users/you/Library/Application Support/Debrief

# Port for http://localhost:<port> (default 4317).
# DEBRIEF_PORT=4317

# AI model and effort (defaults: claude-opus-5-5 and medium).
# DEBRIEF_AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# DEBRIEF_AI_EFFORT=medium
